#: ../../source/docs/common-learning-a-mission.rst:5
#: 2b005864a97b41fe8302e96a56c89149 62bcec73b8f44a5b9e36335f34af39fe
#: 9499980c6bad46ddb5e72bf4f26f6c24
msgid "Recording Waypoints for a Mission"
msgstr "为任务记录航点"

#: ../../source/docs/common-learning-a-mission.rst:7
#: 150ad2dc41d249ba90be091fea7081ef 47d299b639c3475e93ece4acc4c36651
#: 5908e42dda7a4a0798ffca1083cd8877
msgid ""
"Missions can be created by flying (Copter) or driving (Rover) the vehicle "
"around, intermittently recording the vehicle's position as a waypoint by "
"toggling an RC transmitter switch which toggles an RC channel that has been "
"setup as having the :ref:`Auxiliary Function <common-auxiliary-functions>` "
"of \"Save Waypoint\" (function 7)."
msgstr ""
"可以通过驾驶（Copter）或行驶（Rover）飞行器，通过拨动遥控器开关（该开关切换已设置为 :ref:`辅助功能 <common-"
"auxiliary-functions>` 「保存航点」（功能 7）的 RC 通道）间歇性地将飞行器当前位置记录为航点，从而创建任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-learning-a-mission.rst:11
#: 1ab1051cebc442dabb8eb6943cb46239 42bfc1e143424fafb9b51bd5a7aaaa33
#: 51cfa4a7677f4be08eae4559fb0e24ad
msgid ""
"This is just one way to create a mission. Alternatively you can :ref:`plan a"
" mission using Mission Planner <common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-"
"and-events>` or some other GCS."
msgstr ""
"这只是创建任务的一种方式。或者，您可以使用 :ref:`Mission Planner 规划任务 <common-planning-a-mission-"
"with-waypoints-and-events>` 或其他 GCS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-learning-a-mission.rst:14
#: 7afa0d59a33542fba3574d7071dacdae ab1faddee343415584068a9528c1cf7d
#: de2ca916d6684eab8e472ff4c992b593
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-learning-a-mission.rst:16
#: 96fbb1fc5f56452d9fd17391079c9368 9f12cacb9b544635bbe03da94466ad8c
#: cc48760c6b4a42b8a4526faa815ba203
msgid ""
"set the :ref:`Auxiliary Function Switch <common-auxiliary-functions>` to "
"\"Save Waypoint\" by setting and RCx_OPTION for a channel to 7. (Prior to "
"version 4.0, CH7_OPTION was used)"
msgstr ""
"通过将某通道的 RCx_OPTION 设置为 7 来将 :ref:`辅助功能开关 <common-auxiliary-functions>` "
"设置为「保存航点」。（4.0 版本之前使用 CH7_OPTION）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-learning-a-mission.rst:17
#: 75511c2471234e08947b0f364433b8de a66be1b5c55f4f7cb84f30a834d50832
#: e3dce78114bc449b8ecdaadcbbfa21be
msgid "wait for a good position estimate (i.e. LED will turn green)"
msgstr "等待良好的位置估计（即 LED 变绿）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-learning-a-mission.rst:18
#: 2120c406c0184bab8cb35de261625610 2a5ed08085ab4beb90a213ecdec22f65
#: 76f902982e054e0286b6b7d26f50b397
msgid "arm and drive/fly the vehicle around in any mode except Auto."
msgstr "解锁并在 Auto 模式以外的任意模式驾驶/飞行飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-learning-a-mission.rst:19
#: 2d381cf621e1453fab7911ef6ba99cb1 3472a16cffa040fab9db43c50d685378
#: 9938899fae264a7ea6a56b17104c96c8
msgid ""
"when the vehicle is at a position that you would like to record as a "
"waypoint, toggle the auxiliary function switch high (and then return to "
"low). That position and alt.itude will be added as a waypoint to the end of "
"any existing mission list (including an initially blank list)"
msgstr ""
"当飞行器处于想要记录为航点的位置时，将辅助功能开关拨到高位（然后返回低位）。该位置和高度将作为航点添加到现有任务列表末尾（包括初始为空的列表）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-learning-a-mission.rst:20
#: 0f11d3ed1a21463ab3396a0bc32fe12c c37b79a59b1e4334aa0ab43a31e0c51b
#: d46cd9384f9a4d61afa2ab01a8c13ea6
msgid ""
"after recording all points, and adding any additional items like a takeoff "
"or landing, check the mission by connecting with a ground station and then "
"download all waypoints to save if needed in the future.  If using the "
"Mission Planner go to the Flight Plan screen and press the \"Read WPs\" "
"button."
msgstr ""
"记录所有点后，添加任何其他项目（如起飞或降落），通过连接地面站检查任务，然后下载所有航点以便将来需要时保存。如果使用 Mission "
"Planner，请进入飞行计划界面并按 「Read WPs」 按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-learning-a-mission.rst:22
#: 42d9b95055be457ebbd6573ed3cdafbb a075fff4279b4df7b419cb866f292d3e
#: f65041fdcf9a41c8b6467d217d46c92a
msgid ""
"To then execute the mission, switch the vehicle into :ref:`Auto <auto-"
"mode>`."
msgstr "然后要执行任务，将飞行器切换到 :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>` 模式。"
